      "kind": "ReadingPassage",
      "values": {
        "Title": "My Morning Routine",
        "Content": "I wake up at seven o\u0027clock every day. First I wash my face and brush my teeth. Then I put on clean clothes and drink a glass of water. My mother is already in the kitchen, and she smiles when she sees me.\n\nWe eat breakfast together at the table. I usually have bread, eggs, and milk. Sometimes I also eat fruit. After breakfast I pack my school bag and say goodbye. I walk to school with my sister. The morning is quiet and I feel happy.",
